{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And those who came</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other והבאים וגו׳ עם זרובבל (and those who came… with Zerubbabel). To teach: just as here they came of their own accord, so too there they went up of their own accord. And this is like the one who says: they went up of their own accord, and not like the one who says: Ezra brought them up."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:47.486643829Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}